WEBVTT

00:07:36.079 --> 00:08:10.792
★Wendy takes an English vocabulary test at school every week. Her teacher posts a test online, and students access it and take the test. However, her phone broke down this week, and she had to go for one week without a phone. She asked her teacher what she could do and was allowed to take the test on paper this week.
☆☆Question: What did Wendy’s teacher do for Wendy?
